## Enable

1. Register in `cmd/api/register_plugins.go`:

```go
import "github.com/akarso/shopanda/plugins/{{.Slug}}"

// inside registerPlugins:
registry.Register({{.Package}}.New())
```

2. Rebuild and run. Prefer gating on a config flag once you add `plugins.{{.Slug}}.enabled` to `internal/platform/config`.

## Jobs

Use **only** sync job types:

```text
integration.sync.{{.Slug}}.<name>
```

```go
sdk := pluginsdk.New(app, "{{.PluginName}}")
if err := sdk.Integration("{{.Slug}}").RegisterManual("generate", handler); err != nil {
    return err
}
// After boot / BindQueue:
_ = sdk.Integration("{{.Slug}}").Enqueue(ctx, "generate", map[string]interface{}{"id": "..."})
```

Do **not** invent free-form types like `{{.Slug}}.generate` — they are out of scope upstream.

